                        "subtypes": {
                            "Skin Defects": "Excessive preoccupation with practically invisible acne, scars, or complexion.",
                            "Facial Features": "Preoccupation with the shape or size of the nose, eyes, or mouth, which appear normal to others.",
                            "Asymmetry": "Excessive obsession with the face or body not being perfectly symmetrical.",
                            "Muscle Dysmorphia": "The belief that one's body is too small or insufficiently muscular despite being normal or muscular.",
