                        "subtypes": {
                            "Mirror Checking or Avoidance": "Compulsively checking oneself in the mirror frequently or, conversely, avoiding mirrors strictly.",
                            "Excessive Camouflaging": "Spending excessive time and effort to hide perceived flaws using makeup, clothes, hats, or sunglasses.",
                            "Skin Picking": "Picking or manipulating the skin excessively to remove or 'fix' flaws.",
                            "Reassurance Seeking": "Repetitively asking others for confirmation that one's appearance is okay or not strange.",
